{
  "version": 1,
  "spec": "Deed chips: catalog interactions playable directly from the overworld action ring. Data only; each routes through resolveInteraction and encodes unspoken weights via catalog tags. Gates: oncePerDay (per person, resets by day number), minTrust, requiresTheirGoods (holding their cargo or a loan). lines: reaction templates ({name}); failLine: shown when the interaction's assertFailIfMarksAny trips; lend: favor_ask hands you one of their work goods tagged itemTagsAny, to return later. Families: the ring groups verbs into these (at most 6 chips per level); a deed names its family, or joins the family whose catalog choiceSet lists it (talk_choices → Speak). short: the chip text (≤16 chars) when label is longer; label stays the tip and the dev.chips label.",
  "families": [
    {
      "id": "speak",
      "label": "Speak",
      "choiceSetId": "talk_choices"
    },
    {
      "id": "help",
      "label": "Help"
    },
